OHOS: a static composite table mixed dynamic `QString`s with static
`QStringList` references; repeated settings writes could leave a dangling
`QString` behind it and segfault. Rebuild the table as plain values plus a
Latin1 view and a list pointer, applied in one atomic update, which removes
the invalid static-composite initialization rather than just tidying style;
grouping policy, conflict detection and atomic write semantics are
unchanged.

